WEBVTT

00:25.920 --> 00:27.050
When we were little,

00:27.550 --> 00:29.210
you always scrimped and saved

00:29.870 --> 00:31.140
to buy me food.

00:33.450 --> 00:34.600
Eat more.

00:42.320 --> 00:43.150
Sixth Master,

00:44.070 --> 00:45.430
what do we do now?

00:46.400 --> 00:48.490
Zhang Dancheng told me this

00:49.720 --> 00:51.320
because he wants to use me

00:51.780 --> 00:52.970
to kill Sect Master.

00:53.140 --> 00:55.210
Why don't I just kill them all?

00:55.320 --> 00:56.250
Keep them alive.

00:56.810 --> 00:58.210
After I kill Sect Master,

00:58.540 --> 01:00.140
I'm going to make them

01:01.010 --> 01:02.010
take the fall.

01:04.340 --> 01:05.170
Scared?

01:06.700 --> 01:07.580
Sixth Master,

01:08.010 --> 01:10.860
you picked me out of a pile of corpses.

01:10.940 --> 01:12.340
My life is yours.

01:12.560 --> 01:14.090
Whoever you want to kill...

01:15.620 --> 01:17.880
I, Fan Yifei, will be the first to strike.

01:18.730 --> 01:19.530
Let's go.

01:21.060 --> 01:22.990
Bring Shangguan Chengming along.

03:09.370 --> 03:13.120
[A Prophet]

03:13.880 --> 03:16.260
[Episode 23]

03:23.620 --> 03:25.150
Bringing you two back means

03:25.340 --> 03:27.340
I've completed Sect Master's task.

03:27.780 --> 03:28.640
After tonight,

03:28.970 --> 03:30.410
the act you and your mentor put on

03:30.410 --> 03:31.650
can come to an end.

03:32.050 --> 03:33.450
After I kill Sect Master,

03:34.180 --> 03:35.410
I'll let you go.

03:36.250 --> 03:37.460
I may be a scoundrel,

03:38.570 --> 03:40.130
but I keep my word.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.110
[Equally Adept at the Pen and the Sword]

03:59.300 --> 04:00.130
What is it?

04:08.250 --> 04:09.310
I know everything.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.560
Know what?

04:13.380 --> 04:14.580
You killed my mother.

04:19.810 --> 04:20.540
Yes.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.400
You've been lying to me all these years.

04:26.810 --> 04:27.450
Yes.

04:29.210 --> 04:30.100
Why?

04:32.370 --> 04:33.330
I felt like it.

04:35.010 --> 04:35.810
Then today,

04:37.010 --> 04:38.500
let's settle this score.

04:40.130 --> 04:41.190
How do we settle it?

04:46.300 --> 04:47.180
With your life.

04:48.230 --> 04:48.790
Wait!

04:50.659 --> 04:51.720
Since it's the end,

04:52.420 --> 04:54.820
you should at least
let me say my last words.

04:56.740 --> 04:57.450
Go on.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.970
I only have one request.

05:04.690 --> 05:07.010
I want to hear you call me

05:07.010 --> 05:07.860
Dad.

05:09.510 --> 05:11.120
Then I can die in peace.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.120
Call me Dad.

05:19.180 --> 05:19.860
Go on.

05:23.140 --> 05:24.550
Say it.

05:26.450 --> 05:27.420
What's wrong?

05:28.980 --> 05:30.100
Can't say it?

05:31.020 --> 05:32.880
Or do you think I don't deserve it?

05:37.940 --> 05:39.620
No way.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.940
Is it that hard?

05:53.270 --> 05:55.310
I raised you since you were little.

05:56.100 --> 05:58.630
I sent you to a private school
to learn to read,

05:58.690 --> 06:00.660
hired Flying Dagger Li from Shanxi

06:00.660 --> 06:02.450
to teach you martial arts,

06:03.370 --> 06:05.130
and let you live a decent life.

06:05.150 --> 06:08.500
I remember that when you
first joined the sect, you were about 10.

06:08.500 --> 06:10.030
Those Batous bullied you,

06:10.050 --> 06:12.230
stole all the food in your bowl,
leaving you with

06:12.230 --> 06:13.750
only steamed cornbread to eat.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.570
You hid behind this house and cried.

06:15.570 --> 06:16.700
When I witnessed it,

06:17.100 --> 06:17.940
without hesitation,

06:17.940 --> 06:19.060
I gave them 10 lashes each.

06:19.060 --> 06:21.540
From then on, you had meat, endless meat,

06:21.540 --> 06:23.180
every day.

06:23.660 --> 06:25.450
I made that happen.

06:25.940 --> 06:26.890
For this alone,

06:26.910 --> 06:29.960
shouldn't you call me Dad?

06:30.680 --> 06:31.600
There's more.

06:31.620 --> 06:32.820
When you were 15,

06:32.890 --> 06:34.450
you had a huge boil on your butt,

06:34.450 --> 06:35.770
as big as an egg.

06:35.770 --> 06:37.500
No doctor could cure it.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.570
I had no choice

06:38.600 --> 06:40.520
but to cut it open with a knife,

06:40.890 --> 06:42.690
put my mouth on your butt cheek,

06:43.100 --> 06:44.659
and suck the pus out.

06:44.690 --> 06:46.330
I sucked it for 7 days,

06:46.690 --> 06:47.950
before you got better.

06:48.250 --> 06:49.909
You told me not to tell anyone.

06:50.060 --> 06:51.120
I knew you were embarrassed,

06:51.120 --> 06:53.120
so I didn't breathe a word to anyone.

06:53.740 --> 06:54.620
You even said,

06:55.330 --> 06:56.010
"Master,

06:57.420 --> 07:00.660
you treat me better than my own mother."

07:01.810 --> 07:03.610
Even with this,

07:04.370 --> 07:07.570
you still can't call me Dad?

07:11.180 --> 07:11.740
Say it.

07:15.890 --> 07:16.690
Say it.

07:20.330 --> 07:20.860
Dad.

07:21.330 --> 07:23.540
Louder.

07:25.420 --> 07:26.210
Dad!

07:26.210 --> 07:27.010
Good!

07:28.300 --> 07:30.250
You can still call me Dad!

07:30.420 --> 07:31.890
Thank you!

07:31.890 --> 07:33.370
You still want to kill me!

07:33.370 --> 07:35.130
Thank you!

07:35.130 --> 07:37.130
You ingrate!

07:37.130 --> 07:39.770
You'd have starved to death without me!

07:39.860 --> 07:40.890
Even if you lived,

07:40.980 --> 07:43.940
you'd just be some lousy fisherman
in a seaside village.

07:43.940 --> 07:45.300
I killed your mother

07:45.300 --> 07:47.100
to cut off your attachments,

07:47.100 --> 07:50.300
so you could start anew!

07:50.300 --> 07:52.100
And you still want to kill me?

07:55.860 --> 07:56.740
Dad...

07:58.940 --> 07:59.810
Go.

08:00.570 --> 08:02.860
Get my shoe back.

08:37.330 --> 08:38.419
Come.

08:38.730 --> 08:40.179
Put it on for me.

08:49.480 --> 08:51.170
Why couldn't you just

08:52.570 --> 08:54.090
make it easy on yourself?

09:08.970 --> 09:10.780
Now it's my turn to ask you.

09:11.660 --> 09:13.970
Any last words?

09:15.260 --> 09:16.060
Mother,

09:18.180 --> 09:19.810
why do I feel...

09:20.660 --> 09:21.610
so wronged

09:21.900 --> 09:24.420
inside?

09:31.420 --> 09:32.730
I taught you:

09:33.660 --> 09:34.730
to kill,

09:36.260 --> 09:37.390
you must be ruthless

09:38.780 --> 09:39.810
and swift.

09:41.330 --> 09:43.060
You just think too much.

09:52.300 --> 09:54.210
Did you really think I wouldn't know

09:54.210 --> 09:55.670
what you've been plotting

09:56.060 --> 09:57.140
behind my back?

09:58.060 --> 10:00.850
Heavy is my mantle of leadership.

10:01.690 --> 10:02.810
There's no hurry.

10:03.380 --> 10:05.710
I'll personally escort you onto the stage

10:06.420 --> 10:08.450
and let you put on a one-man show.

10:09.380 --> 10:10.570
Take him away.

10:12.660 --> 10:13.810
You, stay.

10:19.490 --> 10:20.570
See that?

10:24.300 --> 10:25.160
Are you scared?

10:25.940 --> 10:26.660
I am.

10:29.610 --> 10:30.940
From now on,

10:31.580 --> 10:32.940
you are him:

10:34.450 --> 10:35.940
the Sixth Batou.

10:40.090 --> 10:41.210
Thank you, Master.

10:43.140 --> 10:45.940
Notify the Batous to gather
in the ancestral hall.

11:06.970 --> 11:08.330
Sixth Batou is dead.

11:13.570 --> 11:14.850
He died because of you.

11:16.800 --> 11:18.090
Back then, you bribed Lu Qinhai

11:18.090 --> 11:20.020
to kill Master Swindler's mother.

11:20.300 --> 11:21.850
You kept it from him for so many years.

11:21.850 --> 11:23.490
When Master Swindler learned of the truth,

11:23.490 --> 11:24.780
you silenced him.

11:26.380 --> 11:28.380
This is your venerable sect master.

11:28.660 --> 11:30.090
Shut up!

11:30.970 --> 11:33.660
It was Sect Master
who saved Master Swindler

11:33.660 --> 11:35.490
and buried his mother back then.

11:35.970 --> 11:36.940
Brothers,

11:37.260 --> 11:39.660
it goes without saying how well

11:39.660 --> 11:41.260
Sect Leader has treated you.

11:41.450 --> 11:43.420
I believe you all know it in your hearts.

11:43.420 --> 11:45.020
Don't let this rogue's nonsense

11:45.020 --> 11:46.820
cause friction within the sect!

11:47.540 --> 11:48.490
Baichuan,

11:48.490 --> 11:50.020
calm down.

11:50.140 --> 11:51.540
Sit.

11:51.540 --> 11:52.180
I've survived

11:52.180 --> 11:55.090
so many years amid rumors.
People have said

11:55.090 --> 11:56.660
all kinds of things about me.

11:56.660 --> 11:58.020
When we were young,

11:58.210 --> 12:01.020
some even said I killed
the old sect master.

12:01.040 --> 12:02.610
Those who say these things

12:02.640 --> 12:05.240
simply want to
revolt against Tianxiang Sect.

12:06.450 --> 12:07.970
What's more terrifying is

12:08.350 --> 12:10.550
that there are our own people involved.

12:10.940 --> 12:12.330
I know very well that

12:13.330 --> 12:15.140
it's more than just one or two.

12:15.540 --> 12:17.020
But don't worry.

12:17.450 --> 12:19.300
As long as I sit on this throne,

12:19.300 --> 12:22.400
I won't let the century-old foundation
of Tianxiang Sect

12:22.400 --> 12:23.570
go up in flames.

12:39.730 --> 12:39.970
Master.

12:39.970 --> 12:40.380
Senior!

12:40.380 --> 12:40.900
Master!

12:41.380 --> 12:41.850
What's wrong?

12:41.850 --> 12:42.900
Master, what's wrong?

12:42.900 --> 12:43.610
Master.

12:44.170 --> 12:45.300
The tea is poisoned.

12:46.170 --> 12:48.850
Lock Shangguan Chengming up!

12:48.880 --> 12:49.720
Yes!

12:51.920 --> 12:52.730
Master.

12:53.200 --> 12:54.550
Senior, are you okay?

13:01.020 --> 13:02.420
Are you alright, Master?

13:03.820 --> 13:06.130
Quick, go brew some alum soup

13:06.570 --> 13:07.540
to detoxify me.

13:09.060 --> 13:10.580
No one follow me.

13:11.140 --> 13:13.730
Let me meditate and channel my qi alone

13:14.250 --> 13:16.130
to try to purge the poison.

13:17.610 --> 13:18.610
Careful, Master.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.240
I'll go right away.

13:35.940 --> 13:36.940
Old man.

13:37.970 --> 13:40.370
You still have to rely on me
when it matters.

13:41.180 --> 13:42.440
I know this place well.

13:44.810 --> 13:47.380
How did you escape from Fan Yifei?

13:48.540 --> 13:50.260
Those small fry under him

13:50.420 --> 13:52.680
can't trap me, the Tongbei Spinning Top.

13:52.680 --> 13:54.040
And Chengming warned me

13:54.070 --> 13:55.070
to drink less.

13:55.570 --> 13:56.430
He doesn't know

13:56.540 --> 13:58.670
it takes a sea of booze to get me buzzed.

14:01.600 --> 14:02.480
Are you okay?

14:02.690 --> 14:03.420
I'm fine.

14:08.260 --> 14:09.390
Where's Chengming?

14:11.190 --> 14:12.070
Who's there?

14:16.690 --> 14:17.720
I'm your father!

14:24.550 --> 14:25.400
Stop!

14:27.100 --> 14:27.940
Stop!

14:41.660 --> 14:42.260
Mentor.

14:43.940 --> 14:45.880
The police tipped Sect Master off
in advance.

14:45.880 --> 14:47.250
Fan Yifei also turned against us.

14:47.250 --> 14:48.730
They're trying to
pin Master Swindler's death

14:48.730 --> 14:49.380
on me

14:49.380 --> 14:50.710
and accuse me of mutiny.

14:50.970 --> 14:51.570
Done.

14:51.570 --> 14:52.540
Leave the premises now.

14:52.540 --> 14:53.180
Okay.

14:55.060 --> 14:55.780
Feiyan,

14:56.300 --> 14:58.490
forget about your lover.

14:58.660 --> 15:00.660
Shangguan Chengming is absolutely

15:00.810 --> 15:02.180
done for this time.

15:02.230 --> 15:04.210
Instead of worrying about Master's health,

15:04.210 --> 15:05.900
you're here being sarcastic.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.160
Where are you going?

15:08.000 --> 15:09.330
To find a doctor for Sect Master.

15:09.330 --> 15:10.430
Should I just stand here

15:10.430 --> 15:11.760
doing nothing like you?

15:12.200 --> 15:13.200
Stop right there!

15:13.690 --> 15:15.110
No one can leave the premises

15:15.110 --> 15:16.900
until Sect Master comes out.

15:30.730 --> 15:31.450
Senior.

15:32.490 --> 15:33.690
The medicine is here.

15:41.970 --> 15:42.810
Senior?

15:44.180 --> 15:45.020
Senior?

15:51.090 --> 15:51.900
Senior?

15:52.690 --> 15:53.490
Senior!

15:54.020 --> 15:54.690
Senior!

16:13.690 --> 16:14.490
Senior!

16:32.140 --> 16:32.970
Senior?

16:36.260 --> 16:37.090
Senior.

16:40.940 --> 16:41.850
Somebody!

16:43.060 --> 16:43.970
Anybody!

16:44.330 --> 16:45.900
Come quickly!

16:46.690 --> 16:47.910
Senior.

16:47.930 --> 16:49.420
What's wrong with Master? Master!

16:49.420 --> 16:50.090
Master!

16:50.380 --> 16:51.490
Master!

16:51.690 --> 16:52.300
Master.

16:52.570 --> 16:53.090
This...

16:53.180 --> 16:53.850
Master.

16:59.330 --> 17:00.260
Senior.

17:01.800 --> 17:02.730
Second Brother.

17:08.099 --> 17:08.940
Senior,

17:10.290 --> 17:12.329
trust that I'll avenge you.

17:13.619 --> 17:14.619
I promise.

17:20.250 --> 17:21.109
Eldest Master,

17:21.339 --> 17:22.800
those two have been let go.

17:23.210 --> 17:24.619
Send this news

17:24.819 --> 17:26.450
to the other Batous.

17:27.079 --> 17:28.560
Sect Master is dead.

17:29.080 --> 17:31.630
The priority is to
set up the funeral altar.

17:34.380 --> 17:35.450
Tell everyone that

17:36.290 --> 17:37.450
whatever it is,

17:38.690 --> 17:40.050
we'll talk at the funeral.

17:40.050 --> 17:41.180
Yes, Eldest Master.

17:58.190 --> 18:00.210
[Honored Ancestor and Leader, Zhou Xingsi]

18:05.530 --> 18:06.530
Eldest Brother,

18:07.660 --> 18:08.940
the time has come.

18:09.620 --> 18:10.480
Eldest Master,

18:11.380 --> 18:12.620
Feiyan isn't here.

18:13.010 --> 18:14.070
Let's wait for her.

18:14.100 --> 18:14.940
Wait for her?

18:15.290 --> 18:18.400
She was the closest
to Shangguan Chengming.

18:18.730 --> 18:21.330
Sect Master is dead,
yet there is no sign of her.

18:21.450 --> 18:23.970
Do you still not realize

18:24.100 --> 18:25.860
who killed Sect Master by now?

18:26.900 --> 18:28.760
Sect Master died an unjust death.

18:28.820 --> 18:31.530
Shouldn't we let him rest in peace first?

18:31.620 --> 18:33.420
The Chief Batou is right!

18:34.580 --> 18:35.940
By the order of the founder,

18:35.940 --> 18:39.250
the heroic soul of Zhou Xingsi,

18:39.340 --> 18:41.540
the 24th Sect Master of Tianxiang Sect,

18:41.770 --> 18:43.630
returns to a divine place of rest!

18:44.450 --> 18:47.140
This soul is a loyal martyr of Tianxiang,

18:47.210 --> 18:48.730
with towering righteousness.

18:48.730 --> 18:52.010
May the Lord of the Underworld show mercy

18:52.340 --> 18:54.140
and decree his swift reincarnation.

18:54.140 --> 18:57.140
Gathering from
all across the land to mourn,

18:57.340 --> 19:00.820
we burn incense to honor our leader!

19:01.730 --> 19:03.590
Sect Master met such a cruel fate,

19:03.690 --> 19:06.350
yet Shangguan Chengming
is nowhere to be found.

19:06.380 --> 19:09.110
What an absolute dishonor
to our Tianxiang Sect.

19:09.580 --> 19:10.530
Today, we

19:10.970 --> 19:12.340
swear a blood oath to

19:12.970 --> 19:14.430
bring that evil scoundrel

19:14.970 --> 19:16.250
back to the sect!

19:22.620 --> 19:24.480
To the disloyal and treacherous...

19:24.480 --> 19:26.740
-behold this lotus!
-Behold this lotus!

19:33.010 --> 19:35.770
I was with Sect Master the longest.

19:36.580 --> 19:38.580
And you're next after me, right?

19:40.180 --> 19:42.140
Say, were we blind

19:42.140 --> 19:44.210
or just completely stupid

19:44.210 --> 19:46.250
to ever trust Shangguan Chengming?

19:46.580 --> 19:49.310
He was Sect Master's blessing
in his later years.

19:49.990 --> 19:51.270
At that age,

19:52.250 --> 19:54.140
who wouldn't hope for a son?

19:54.180 --> 19:55.260
That's true.

19:58.420 --> 19:59.750
I heard that some people

19:59.780 --> 20:03.040
in the sect have been wanting
to flip the tables for a while.

20:04.180 --> 20:05.970
It's just a few unseasoned punks

20:05.970 --> 20:07.490
wagging their tongues.

20:09.490 --> 20:10.970
Your loyalty to Sect Master

20:10.970 --> 20:13.100
is obvious to all.

20:13.290 --> 20:14.450
I just want

20:14.840 --> 20:16.720
to lead a simple

20:16.830 --> 20:18.380
and peaceful life.

20:19.050 --> 20:20.100
I don't want

20:20.660 --> 20:21.580
anything else.

20:21.580 --> 20:23.140
A peaceful life is good.

20:23.770 --> 20:25.580
I want a peaceful life too.

20:26.660 --> 20:27.490
But

20:27.620 --> 20:29.240
Sect Master put so much effort

20:29.240 --> 20:31.120
into establishing this foundation,

20:31.120 --> 20:32.840
only to leave just like that.

20:33.380 --> 20:34.140
I...

20:34.970 --> 20:36.490
As his junior,

20:36.530 --> 20:38.770
shouldn't I protect the empire he built

20:39.420 --> 20:41.900
even if it costs me my life?

20:46.040 --> 20:46.900
Eldest Master,

20:47.940 --> 20:49.380
I'm not good with subtleties.

20:49.380 --> 20:50.530
Just give it

20:50.970 --> 20:51.970
to me straight.

20:51.970 --> 20:52.660
Alright.

20:55.660 --> 20:57.120
Fill Second Master's cup.

21:03.270 --> 21:04.180
Huaiyi,

21:04.560 --> 21:06.690
there are some things I can't spell out

21:06.820 --> 21:08.210
in the ancestral hall.

21:08.860 --> 21:10.940
I know you like Feiyan.

21:11.420 --> 21:14.340
But at a critical moment like this,

21:14.770 --> 21:15.820
I advise you

21:16.530 --> 21:19.090
to keep your hands clean.

21:37.210 --> 21:38.730
I can't believe

21:39.340 --> 21:41.210
Shangguan Chengming

21:41.210 --> 21:43.250
really killed Sect Master.

21:44.210 --> 21:45.620
You think it was him too?

21:45.730 --> 21:47.100
To prevent Sect Master

21:47.210 --> 21:49.900
from killing his mentor,

21:50.490 --> 21:52.770
that hypocrite struck first

21:52.900 --> 21:54.230
to kill the Sect Master,

21:54.580 --> 21:56.900
and then fled.

21:57.250 --> 21:58.530
There's no way

21:59.690 --> 22:01.900
Shangguan Chengming is the killer.

22:04.450 --> 22:05.530
It's not him?

22:06.970 --> 22:08.210
If not him,

22:08.490 --> 22:09.490
who else could it be?

22:09.490 --> 22:10.420
Think about it.

22:10.490 --> 22:12.150
The killer struck right after

22:12.340 --> 22:13.730
Zhang Dancheng returned.

22:13.730 --> 22:16.860
Isn't it obvious they're framing
Shangguan Chengming?

22:18.210 --> 22:19.340
This person

22:20.620 --> 22:21.900
was too impatient.

22:22.580 --> 22:24.340
The mantis stalks the cicada,

22:25.180 --> 22:26.840
unaware of the oriole behind.

22:27.180 --> 22:28.490
Now,

22:28.490 --> 22:31.140
I see mantises and cicadas everywhere,

22:31.420 --> 22:34.210
but the oriole is nowhere to be found.

22:34.620 --> 22:37.500
Chief Batou ordered
Shangguan Chengming's arrest.

22:37.500 --> 22:39.730
We're not getting involved in this mess,

22:39.730 --> 22:41.450
lest we get blindsided

22:41.620 --> 22:42.660
by the oriole.

22:43.100 --> 22:44.660
From the looks of it,

22:45.290 --> 22:47.970
someone is trying to revolt.

22:49.100 --> 22:50.050
Third Brother,

22:50.440 --> 22:53.570
who do you think it could be?

22:56.210 --> 22:58.580
Second Brother isn't ambitious.

22:58.730 --> 23:00.050
He just wants a peaceful end.

23:00.050 --> 23:01.660
He wouldn't do such a thing.

23:02.050 --> 23:04.140
Fourth Brother thinks he's above it all,

23:04.140 --> 23:05.800
so it definitely can't be him.

23:05.900 --> 23:06.860
Could it be...

23:07.970 --> 23:09.010
Eldest Brother?

23:10.970 --> 23:11.770
Qin Baichuan?

23:12.450 --> 23:14.860
He's been in Suhang for a long time,

23:15.010 --> 23:18.180
so there's little news of him.

23:18.180 --> 23:19.530
I wouldn't even know

23:19.820 --> 23:21.220
where to begin guessing.

23:22.620 --> 23:26.730
Then who do you think
we should side with this time?

23:28.380 --> 23:29.380
Side with whom?

23:29.380 --> 23:31.690
At a time like this,
we brothers should just

23:31.690 --> 23:34.350
sit on the fence and see
which way the wind blows.

23:34.490 --> 23:36.290
Whichever way the wind blows...

23:36.730 --> 23:38.380
The grass bends.

23:40.250 --> 23:41.180
Third Brother.

23:42.620 --> 23:43.620
Second Master,

23:43.770 --> 23:46.210
I know you want a peaceful life now

23:46.700 --> 23:48.900
and no longer wish to live by swindling.

23:49.010 --> 23:50.810
But now that Sect Master is dead,

23:51.100 --> 23:53.940
do you think the sect will know peace?

23:57.340 --> 23:58.010
Someone

23:58.620 --> 24:00.620
set a trap for Shangguan Chengming.

24:00.940 --> 24:01.860
He won't

24:02.620 --> 24:03.880
get out of this easily.

24:04.380 --> 24:05.380
You came to me

24:06.940 --> 24:08.730
instead of going to mourn

24:09.290 --> 24:10.250
Sect Master.

24:11.580 --> 24:13.440
You want me to help him, don't you?

24:13.450 --> 24:14.380
Second Brother,

24:15.050 --> 24:16.320
in the entire sect,

24:17.530 --> 24:19.660
you were the most loyal to Sect Master.

24:19.770 --> 24:21.970
But his death is shrouded

24:22.140 --> 24:23.140
in mystery.

24:23.290 --> 24:24.530
You and I

24:25.250 --> 24:26.620
can't just let it go.

24:30.380 --> 24:32.250
Just take care of yourself.

24:32.660 --> 24:34.210
I just hope you can

24:34.490 --> 24:35.490
fly higher

24:36.860 --> 24:37.770
and further.

24:45.940 --> 24:46.660
Mentor,

24:47.210 --> 24:48.530
I've bought your ticket

24:48.530 --> 24:49.900
to Pangzhou.

24:50.820 --> 24:52.220
At this stage of the plan,

24:52.320 --> 24:53.320
you can

24:54.140 --> 24:55.450
leave the rest to me.

24:59.970 --> 25:02.970
The 36 revolutions of the Kan and Li;
yet there remains

25:03.340 --> 25:06.140
the meeting of the Dragon and Tiger
in the dantian.

25:07.580 --> 25:09.530
This is the final hurdle.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.850
Whether you can cross it

25:11.890 --> 25:13.530
is in the hands of destiny.

25:13.560 --> 25:14.670
Don't worry.

25:15.620 --> 25:17.050
I've dug the graves for

25:17.900 --> 25:18.960
the remaining few.

25:19.010 --> 25:20.380
As your mentor,

25:20.970 --> 25:23.250
I've taught you everything I know.

25:26.100 --> 25:27.490
I'm getting old.

25:28.180 --> 25:29.580
All I see

25:30.140 --> 25:31.730
are old grudges.

25:31.970 --> 25:33.660
But you can see very far.

25:34.380 --> 25:35.450
Right now,

25:35.580 --> 25:38.310
I just want Tianxiang Sect
wiped from this world.

25:38.620 --> 25:40.250
I don't want anyone else...

25:41.710 --> 25:43.770
to get caught up in grudges like mine.

25:53.770 --> 25:54.620
Mentor.

26:43.660 --> 26:44.690
Please come in.

26:45.090 --> 26:46.780
[Chunfeng House]

26:53.770 --> 26:54.380
Come in.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.620
You sure are bold to

27:01.970 --> 27:03.300
run around when they are

27:03.490 --> 27:04.380
hunting you down.

27:04.380 --> 27:05.710
Now the sect is in chaos,

27:05.820 --> 27:07.210
with Qin Baichuan in charge.

27:07.210 --> 27:09.210
His ambition is no secret to anyone.

27:09.940 --> 27:11.210
So what's your plan?

27:12.660 --> 27:14.390
I've got my eye on a scam target.

27:14.530 --> 27:15.420
He has the

27:15.420 --> 27:17.340
inside information
on Qin Baichuan's rebellion.

27:17.340 --> 27:18.450
Do me a favor.

27:18.770 --> 27:19.490
Go find him

27:20.020 --> 27:21.450
and get the evidence.

27:22.860 --> 27:24.860
Here are the address and the ticket.

27:30.190 --> 27:32.680
[13 Wanping Road, Qiu Mansion, Pujiang]

27:33.340 --> 27:34.100
Pujiang.

27:35.340 --> 27:36.340
That's quite far.

27:38.340 --> 27:39.250
What about you?

27:39.490 --> 27:40.970
Staying here all alone,

27:41.940 --> 27:43.470
what are you planning to do?

27:44.420 --> 27:45.140
I'll be—

27:45.140 --> 27:47.000
They're hunting you everywhere.

27:47.380 --> 27:48.530
How about this?

27:49.210 --> 27:50.210
You go find him.

27:50.490 --> 27:51.620
It's a good chance

27:52.770 --> 27:53.860
to lay low.

27:53.990 --> 27:56.450
To take this throne,
you're the first person

27:57.030 --> 27:58.900
Qin Baichuan will try to eliminate.

27:58.900 --> 28:00.900
You're the chief of Yuehaitang Branch,

28:00.900 --> 28:02.900
which makes you his biggest threat.

28:03.730 --> 28:05.590
It's not safe for you to stay here.

28:11.760 --> 28:13.020
Shangguan Chengming,

28:14.670 --> 28:16.930
so you're sending me away because you are

28:17.850 --> 28:19.250
worried about my safety.

28:19.940 --> 28:21.860
Then you can stay behind alone

28:22.580 --> 28:24.180
and fight them all.

28:25.210 --> 28:25.970
Right?

28:32.370 --> 28:33.450
As you know...

28:35.140 --> 28:37.270
until Tianxiang Sect is annihilated,

28:38.510 --> 28:39.800
I'm staying right here—

28:39.410 --> 28:42.730
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

28:42.750 --> 28:45.640
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

28:46.250 --> 28:49.770
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

28:49.800 --> 28:52.640
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

28:53.220 --> 28:56.840
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

28:56.870 --> 28:59.690
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

29:00.460 --> 29:03.590
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

29:03.610 --> 29:08.010
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

29:11.770 --> 29:13.140
You said it yourself:

29:13.970 --> 29:16.170
If you fear death,
go home and rear pigs.

30:09.660 --> 30:11.010
Since everyone is here,

30:11.330 --> 30:14.290
we must allow Sect Master to
rest in peace today.

30:15.940 --> 30:16.800
Eldest Master,

30:17.250 --> 30:18.290
don't you agree?

30:18.940 --> 30:20.800
You're very thoughtful, Feiyan.

30:20.970 --> 30:21.730
Now,

30:22.210 --> 30:24.100
bring Shangguan Chengming in!

30:32.290 --> 30:33.090
Jiang Feiyan,

30:33.490 --> 30:34.900
you captured him.

30:35.990 --> 30:37.710
The credit goes to you.

30:37.740 --> 30:39.350
But it's not your place

30:39.420 --> 30:41.020
to speak here.

30:41.210 --> 30:42.050
Men,

30:42.290 --> 30:43.720
drag him out and execute him!

30:43.720 --> 30:45.850
Let's see who dares to lay a hand on him!

30:46.250 --> 30:47.510
Since when does a woman

30:47.900 --> 30:49.900
call the shots in Tianxiang Sect?

30:49.930 --> 30:52.620
Tianxiang Sect has abandoned
the fight for justice.

30:52.620 --> 30:54.680
Does it matter if a woman is in charge?

30:55.180 --> 30:56.110
Starting today,

30:56.400 --> 30:57.730
whoever is most capable

30:57.840 --> 30:59.430
will rule Tianxiang Sect!

31:01.530 --> 31:02.690
So you want to be

31:03.050 --> 31:04.920
the new sect master?

31:05.050 --> 31:06.110
You got that right.

31:06.770 --> 31:08.660
I want to be the sect master

31:08.860 --> 31:10.320
and establish my own sect.

31:24.660 --> 31:25.490
Come clean.

31:25.770 --> 31:26.730
Who ordered you

31:27.530 --> 31:29.050
to kill Sect Master?

31:32.490 --> 31:33.140
Answer me!

31:34.100 --> 31:36.300
Since you're throwing me under the bus,

31:37.100 --> 31:38.660
I'll spill everything.

31:39.970 --> 31:40.570
It was him,

31:40.620 --> 31:41.450
Qin Baichuan.

31:41.620 --> 31:43.490
He wanted me to pose as Sect Master's son

31:43.490 --> 31:44.550
to get close to him,

31:44.660 --> 31:46.490
gain his absolute trust, and then strike

31:46.490 --> 31:47.950
when the moment was right!

31:51.820 --> 31:53.100
Shangguan Chengming,

31:53.210 --> 31:55.340
you're quite the strategist, huh?

31:56.010 --> 31:58.450
It wasn't me who wanted Sect Master dead

31:58.450 --> 32:00.730
but you and Jiang Feiyan!

32:02.140 --> 32:03.250
In 1928,

32:03.580 --> 32:04.730
Wang Jiaxian

32:05.100 --> 32:06.030
and Jiang Feiyan

32:06.380 --> 32:07.660
tied the knot.

32:08.010 --> 32:08.970
I found this

32:09.100 --> 32:11.420
from your hometown, Jianghuai.

32:11.530 --> 32:12.450
One of you

32:12.660 --> 32:14.520
pretended to be Sect Master's son

32:14.660 --> 32:15.660
to poison him,

32:15.660 --> 32:17.050
while the other covered it up

32:17.050 --> 32:18.580
and joined the scam.

32:18.730 --> 32:20.860
You haven't even wiped your own asses,

32:20.940 --> 32:23.870
and you're trying to
dump your feces on someone else?

32:24.050 --> 32:24.900
Everyone,

32:25.050 --> 32:26.490
what is the punishment

32:26.690 --> 32:27.970
for treachery?

32:27.970 --> 32:29.050
Human oil candle!

32:29.050 --> 32:30.420
Yes, human oil candle!

32:30.770 --> 32:33.860
Arrest Jiang Feiyan and Wang Jiaxian!

32:33.860 --> 32:35.280
Treachery does warrant

32:36.350 --> 32:37.900
the human oil candle punishment.

32:37.900 --> 32:39.660
But it's still uncertain

32:40.180 --> 32:41.510
who the real traitor is.

32:42.210 --> 32:44.140
I have a piece of evidence here too.

32:44.300 --> 32:45.610
Will you read it...

32:48.050 --> 32:49.290
or will your son,

32:49.940 --> 32:51.210
Qin Huiming, read it?

32:55.690 --> 32:56.290
Go,

32:56.490 --> 32:58.080
get us brothers another pot of wine.

32:58.080 --> 32:59.210
Yes, Eldest Master.

33:13.210 --> 33:13.820
How was it?

33:15.000 --> 33:16.830
I eavesdropped outside the window
for a long time,

33:16.830 --> 33:18.420
but I heard nothing unusual.

33:18.420 --> 33:20.690
They talked about protecting
Sect Master's empire,

33:20.690 --> 33:22.070
and Qin Baichuan told Second Master

33:22.070 --> 33:22.790
to stay away

33:22.820 --> 33:23.770
from Fifth Batou.

33:23.770 --> 33:25.370
Qin Baichuan is threatening

33:25.530 --> 33:26.730
Second Batou into

33:26.730 --> 33:28.010
handing over Jiang Feiyan.

33:28.010 --> 33:29.940
So he's the one who wants to revolt.

33:30.210 --> 33:31.140
He bided his time

33:31.180 --> 33:32.400
and finally got the chance.

33:32.400 --> 33:34.290
Qin Baichuan wants to
pull Second Batou to his side.

33:34.290 --> 33:36.210
Then they're about to make a move.

33:36.450 --> 33:38.820
Second Batou might not necessarily
join his sinking ship.

33:38.820 --> 33:39.650
But I bet

33:40.100 --> 33:41.600
Qin Baichuan has a backup plan.

33:41.600 --> 33:43.200
During their conversation,

33:43.230 --> 33:45.000
a gofer was there the whole time.

33:45.000 --> 33:45.940
Why wasn't Qin Baichuan

33:45.940 --> 33:48.380
worried about the gofer
hearing such secrets?

33:48.380 --> 33:51.090
Qin Baichuan probably
wanted the gofer to hear it.

33:51.090 --> 33:52.220
Where's that gofer?

34:02.690 --> 34:03.750
It's been forever,

34:03.820 --> 34:05.050
and still, nobody has

34:05.050 --> 34:06.310
touched base with him.

34:06.530 --> 34:07.450
How about I just

34:08.780 --> 34:09.580
grab him here?

34:09.610 --> 34:10.340
A few punches

34:10.489 --> 34:11.350
and he'll talk.

34:12.340 --> 34:13.540
Catching him is easy.

34:13.630 --> 34:14.739
If Qin Baichuan

34:14.739 --> 34:16.350
secures proof of our rebellion,

34:16.350 --> 34:17.659
we're dead either way.

34:18.820 --> 34:19.420
Why are

34:19.420 --> 34:21.750
the mosquitoes only biting me and not you?

34:28.610 --> 34:29.570
I'll follow him.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.429
You go to the river

34:30.429 --> 34:32.300
and see if he left anything behind.

34:32.300 --> 34:33.449
Stay put. I'll go.

34:33.780 --> 34:35.420
If his contact shows up,

34:35.699 --> 34:37.300
I can handle them.

34:37.820 --> 34:38.489
Okay.

35:30.170 --> 35:31.130
Brothers,

35:31.380 --> 35:32.510
Sect Master is dead.

35:33.090 --> 35:34.450
Before the funeral altar,

35:34.450 --> 35:35.940
burning incense is the signal.

35:35.940 --> 35:37.480
Raise the banner of justice,

35:37.480 --> 35:39.010
revolt, and seize the sect.

35:39.220 --> 35:40.530
From Qin Huiming.

35:41.220 --> 35:42.080
Eldest Master,

35:42.120 --> 35:44.760
you're truly blessed in this life.

35:44.800 --> 35:46.160
You actually have a son.

35:46.450 --> 35:48.110
Why didn't you tell everyone?

35:51.240 --> 35:53.880
Do you think you can sling mud

35:54.340 --> 35:55.780
with a fake letter?

35:55.800 --> 35:57.660
How is it that your photos are real

35:58.010 --> 35:59.490
but my evidence is fake?

35:59.600 --> 36:00.470
Besides,

36:00.820 --> 36:02.170
he is right here.

36:03.700 --> 36:04.830
We'll know the truth

36:05.100 --> 36:06.480
once we test it.

36:08.860 --> 36:09.570
Enough!

36:10.260 --> 36:11.470
Shangguan Chengming,

36:11.470 --> 36:12.740
you deceived Sixth Batou,

36:12.740 --> 36:13.700
killed Sect Master,

36:13.700 --> 36:15.260
and dragged Feiyan into danger with you.

36:15.260 --> 36:16.420
Isn't that enough?

36:16.530 --> 36:17.740
Now you're here falsely

36:17.740 --> 36:18.970
accusing Chief Batou!

36:18.970 --> 36:19.830
Second Master,

36:19.860 --> 36:21.630
you've followed Sect Master for so long.

36:21.630 --> 36:23.710
You wouldn't want him to roll over

36:24.260 --> 36:25.590
in his grave, would you?

36:27.570 --> 36:28.450
Eldest Master,

36:28.700 --> 36:29.780
it's simple.

36:31.050 --> 36:32.580
Trade this gofer's life...

36:34.420 --> 36:35.820
to prove your innocence.

36:41.850 --> 36:42.710
Eldest Master.

36:47.300 --> 36:47.650
Okay,

36:48.340 --> 36:49.140
I'll help you.

36:52.610 --> 36:53.940
He is my son!

36:54.340 --> 36:55.090
I'm...

36:55.230 --> 36:57.110
I'm revolting today!

37:00.090 --> 37:01.750
I've already deployed my men.

37:02.170 --> 37:03.940
Zhou is already dead!

37:04.130 --> 37:05.660
The position of Sect Master

37:06.130 --> 37:08.270
belongs to me, Qin Baichuan!

37:08.300 --> 37:09.160
Eldest Master!

37:10.020 --> 37:11.830
Freeze! Drop your knives!

37:11.860 --> 37:15.010
Freeze! Drop your knives!

37:16.340 --> 37:17.900
Where did you come from?

37:23.960 --> 37:25.850
The men you placed in ambush

37:26.780 --> 37:27.980
outside the city were

37:28.170 --> 37:29.340
all wiped out by me.

37:29.420 --> 37:29.970
You...

37:31.220 --> 37:32.300
Interesting.

37:50.500 --> 37:51.540
How interesting.

37:52.230 --> 37:54.430
I've attended many funerals in my life,

37:55.340 --> 37:57.450
but attending my own

37:57.640 --> 37:59.110
is a first.

38:02.380 --> 38:04.700
Quick, go brew some alum soup

38:05.120 --> 38:05.970
to detoxify me.

38:05.970 --> 38:07.090
Careful, Master.

38:07.610 --> 38:08.700
I'll go right away.

38:40.680 --> 38:41.590
You're here.

38:42.160 --> 38:43.030
Yes, I'm here.

38:47.650 --> 38:50.360
What are all those people
waiting for outside?

38:51.270 --> 38:52.540
Waiting for me to die.

39:01.700 --> 39:02.490
Come on.

39:03.490 --> 39:05.490
You've worked hard all these years.

39:06.560 --> 39:08.370
Let me pour you a cup of tea.

39:11.250 --> 39:12.310
Thank you, Master.

39:12.410 --> 39:13.220
Drink up.

39:21.300 --> 39:22.760
Is your family doing well?

39:22.780 --> 39:23.450
Yes,

39:23.650 --> 39:24.490
they're good.

39:25.610 --> 39:27.570
I know you have 3 kids.

39:27.620 --> 39:28.650
Are your finances okay?

39:28.650 --> 39:29.380
Yes,

39:29.400 --> 39:31.060
you've always been generous.

39:33.220 --> 39:34.860
When things ease up,

39:35.860 --> 39:36.860
take a trip home.

39:36.940 --> 39:39.820
Spend some quality time
with your wife and kids.

39:40.020 --> 39:42.170
It's been a while
since you went back, right?

39:42.170 --> 39:43.230
Thank you, Master.

39:45.160 --> 39:46.360
Over the years...

40:06.550 --> 40:07.760
Don't worry.

40:08.090 --> 40:10.070
I'll take good care
of your family for you.

40:10.070 --> 40:11.520
No one can leave the premises

40:11.520 --> 40:13.290
until Sect Master comes out.

40:15.910 --> 40:16.790
Senior?

40:17.610 --> 40:18.420
Senior?

40:18.900 --> 40:19.650
Senior!

40:20.300 --> 40:21.630
Somebody come quickly!

40:22.170 --> 40:22.700
Senior?

40:22.860 --> 40:23.420
Senior!

40:23.700 --> 40:24.610
What happened to Sect Master?

40:24.610 --> 40:24.940
Sect Master!

40:24.940 --> 40:25.420
Master!

40:25.940 --> 40:27.170
Master!

40:27.700 --> 40:28.450
Senior,

40:28.900 --> 40:30.700
trust that I'll avenge you.

40:31.170 --> 40:32.220
I promise.

40:37.530 --> 40:38.010
S-Sect...

40:38.010 --> 40:38.740
Sect Master?

40:40.340 --> 40:41.220
Qin,

40:42.780 --> 40:44.450
if you want my throne,

40:44.680 --> 40:46.030
just say it.

40:46.300 --> 40:47.560
Why go to such lengths?

40:49.250 --> 40:51.330
You knew he was Wang Jiaxian,

40:51.530 --> 40:52.300
but you kept mum,

40:52.300 --> 40:54.260
so as to use him to do your dirty work.

40:54.260 --> 40:55.300
Director Wang,

40:55.910 --> 40:58.200
what punishment does this call for?

40:58.410 --> 41:00.820
The father and son,
Qin Baichuan and Qin Huiming,

41:00.820 --> 41:03.430
defrauded the people
and committed murder for money.

41:03.430 --> 41:04.840
They deserve to die.

41:05.650 --> 41:06.510
Death penalty.

41:06.780 --> 41:07.700
Execute them on the spot.

41:07.700 --> 41:08.060
Take them away!

41:08.060 --> 41:08.830
Wait.

41:09.520 --> 41:11.480
Let me say one thing before you go.

41:14.610 --> 41:15.700
As things stand,

41:15.760 --> 41:18.390
this is where we part ways, my brother.

41:19.050 --> 41:21.110
There's nothing else I can do for you.

41:21.720 --> 41:22.520
Tell you what,

41:23.070 --> 41:25.550
I'll pay for the bullets to execute you.

41:27.460 --> 41:28.340
Director Wang,

41:28.780 --> 41:30.040
buy a few more bullets.

41:30.340 --> 41:31.340
That's a lot.

41:32.970 --> 41:33.640
Take him away.

41:33.640 --> 41:34.840
You old fox!

41:35.090 --> 41:36.470
You'll meet a dreadful end!

41:36.470 --> 41:38.200
I'll haunt you from the grave!

41:38.380 --> 41:39.450
You old fox!

41:39.610 --> 41:41.380
You'll die a horrible death!

41:41.700 --> 41:42.560
Director Wang,

41:42.570 --> 41:43.700
since you're here,

41:43.700 --> 41:45.360
have a cup of tea before you go.

41:45.360 --> 41:47.160
I have official business to handle,

41:47.160 --> 41:48.280
so I won't stay.

41:48.530 --> 41:50.370
Let's catch up another day.

41:50.400 --> 41:51.350
Another day.

41:55.490 --> 41:56.380
Just one shot?

41:57.490 --> 41:58.420
Give it a second.

42:00.420 --> 42:01.170
Satisfying.

42:01.340 --> 42:01.970
All done.

42:02.450 --> 42:03.130
Thank you.

42:03.580 --> 42:04.640
I'll take my leave.

42:15.530 --> 42:17.610
Wang Jiaxian,

42:17.970 --> 42:19.010
right?

42:19.420 --> 42:20.300
I set the scene

42:20.300 --> 42:21.650
perfectly for you.

42:22.650 --> 42:24.780
How did you mess it up like this?

42:26.170 --> 42:27.370
I'll get to the point.

42:27.610 --> 42:29.090
Tomorrow at Yunhe Temple,

42:29.170 --> 42:31.450
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan
will be subjected to

42:31.450 --> 42:32.900
the human oil candle punishment.

42:32.900 --> 42:34.050
Do it the old way,

42:34.300 --> 42:36.010
full scale and by the book.

42:43.160 --> 42:45.010
You guys, keep a close eye on them.

42:45.010 --> 42:45.860
Yes!

42:47.490 --> 42:49.940
Shangguan Chengming and Jiang Feiyan

42:50.130 --> 42:51.740
both played themselves.

42:52.090 --> 42:53.420
What a ruthless move

42:53.860 --> 42:54.940
from Sect Master.

42:55.220 --> 42:56.820
By feigning dead,

42:57.010 --> 42:59.410
he not only rooted out these two traitors,

42:59.650 --> 43:01.740
but even got rid of Qin Baichuan,

43:01.740 --> 43:03.270
the long-standing threat.

43:04.010 --> 43:04.740
Brilliant.

43:06.010 --> 43:07.340
Absolutely brilliant.

43:07.940 --> 43:08.970
Third Brother,

43:09.940 --> 43:11.450
now only Second Brother

43:11.610 --> 43:12.820
is above you.

43:13.530 --> 43:14.490
And Sect Master

43:14.650 --> 43:15.860
told us to handle

43:15.860 --> 43:18.090
the human oil candle punishment well.

43:18.170 --> 43:19.030
Why do you think

43:19.700 --> 43:20.700
that is?

43:25.700 --> 43:27.220
Sect Master has run out of

43:27.450 --> 43:29.180
competent people he can trust.

43:29.530 --> 43:31.700
Our chance has come.

43:44.700 --> 43:45.700
Have some tea.

43:50.820 --> 43:51.380
Master,

43:51.530 --> 43:53.260
you raised Feiyan yourself.

43:53.650 --> 43:55.850
She's basically half a daughter to you.

43:56.170 --> 43:57.650
Please spare her life.

43:57.860 --> 43:58.940
The tea is cold.

43:59.420 --> 44:00.880
Go get some boiling water.

44:04.050 --> 44:04.700
Master,

44:05.010 --> 44:06.010
Feiyan has worked

44:06.130 --> 44:08.300
tirelessly for the sect all these years.

44:08.300 --> 44:10.340
Her efforts alone deserve credit.

44:10.570 --> 44:12.830
Think of how much money she's made for us.

44:12.940 --> 44:14.130
It's not worth

44:14.380 --> 44:15.780
losing one of our Batous

44:17.300 --> 44:18.700
over that punk, Master!

44:25.220 --> 44:27.450
I know you have a soft spot for her

44:28.530 --> 44:30.130
and can't bear to see her die.

44:30.220 --> 44:31.860
I don't have the heart to either.

44:31.860 --> 44:33.450
I want to spare her too,

44:33.900 --> 44:36.380
but the rules are the rules.

44:43.420 --> 44:44.220
I understand.

44:46.470 --> 44:47.800
A life for a life.

44:49.490 --> 44:50.900
What's with this act now?

44:51.000 --> 44:52.740
I think you've watched too many plays,
trying to be

44:52.740 --> 44:53.790
the knight in shining armor.

44:53.790 --> 44:54.780
Listen up.

44:55.380 --> 44:56.420
Those stories are

44:56.450 --> 44:59.010
made up by actors to sell tickets.

44:59.220 --> 45:00.620
Those are performances!

45:00.900 --> 45:02.530
Life only begins after

45:02.860 --> 45:04.260
you step off the stage.

45:04.420 --> 45:06.100
Feiyan's time is up.

45:06.130 --> 45:07.450
She must die.

45:07.450 --> 45:08.780
It's not a decision I made.

45:08.780 --> 45:10.860
It's arranged by heaven.

45:12.170 --> 45:13.420
You want to help her?

45:14.420 --> 45:15.380
Fine.

45:21.050 --> 45:22.580
Make your strike accurate.

45:22.940 --> 45:24.450
Give her a quick end

45:24.940 --> 45:26.780
so she suffers less.

45:28.940 --> 45:32.610
Just like how I killed Shangguan Hong
with my own hands back then.

45:36.380 --> 45:37.170
Huaiyi,

45:38.380 --> 45:41.380
transcend romantic attachments,

45:42.970 --> 45:44.530
and you'll be king.

46:01.420 --> 46:02.150
Understood.

46:17.940 --> 46:36.120
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

46:32.220 --> 46:33.050
Feiyan,

46:33.650 --> 46:34.940
back then,

46:36.170 --> 46:38.220
you used to warm up your voice

46:39.380 --> 46:40.420
and practice

46:41.650 --> 46:42.710
in this courtyard.

46:46.740 --> 46:48.820
I was so hopeless back then.

46:50.390 --> 46:51.550
I always liked to

46:52.260 --> 46:53.740
secretly watch you

46:54.170 --> 46:55.220
from afar.

46:56.260 --> 46:57.090
Just watching

46:58.260 --> 46:59.220
and watching...

47:02.780 --> 47:04.220
Until the day I saw you

47:05.050 --> 47:06.220
put on the makeup,

47:06.780 --> 47:07.910
step onto the stage,

47:08.130 --> 47:10.330
and win the applause of the whole house.

47:11.970 --> 47:14.490
I can no longer protect you anymore.

47:14.840 --> 47:15.570
Remember,

47:16.220 --> 47:18.890
you must fly higher...

47:20.170 --> 47:21.090
and go

47:21.490 --> 47:22.450
further.

48:28.740 --> 48:30.140
I'll just say a few words.

48:37.810 --> 48:38.740
Fourth Brother.

48:40.700 --> 48:41.820
Chengming,

48:43.860 --> 48:45.520
it was a pleasure knowing you.

48:45.530 --> 48:47.260
You'll be on your way tomorrow.

48:47.260 --> 48:48.380
Let's have a drink

48:48.380 --> 48:49.900
as my farewell to you.

48:50.300 --> 48:51.230
Fourth Brother,

48:51.820 --> 48:53.750
you're putting yourself in danger

48:54.050 --> 48:55.090
by visiting me.

48:55.450 --> 48:56.420
Don't worry.

48:56.700 --> 48:58.910
In Tianxiang Sect, I alone
master Western knowledge.

48:58.910 --> 49:00.910
Sect Master can't afford to kill me.

49:03.340 --> 49:04.790
I just hate myself for

49:05.570 --> 49:07.050
not being able to save you.

49:09.220 --> 49:10.150
Fourth Brother,

49:18.700 --> 49:20.570
please do me one last favor.

49:30.300 --> 49:31.160
Fourth Master,

49:31.300 --> 49:32.340
Sect Master ordered

49:32.340 --> 49:34.380
that no one
who's seen Shangguan Chengming

49:34.380 --> 49:35.530
is allowed to leave.

49:40.190 --> 49:43.190
With the war intensifying outside,

49:43.330 --> 49:45.210
word has come down from the top

49:46.090 --> 49:49.040
that Yucheng is now
our official rear base.

49:49.320 --> 49:50.880
With this decree,

49:50.940 --> 49:52.340
the military and police systems

49:52.340 --> 49:54.490
in Yucheng have undergone multiple purges.

49:54.490 --> 49:56.000
It's recent: the deputy director

49:56.000 --> 49:57.340
from headquarters,

49:57.340 --> 49:59.300
his name and identity are all kept secret.

49:59.300 --> 50:00.430
No one knows a thing.

50:01.050 --> 50:02.380
My words don't carry

50:02.700 --> 50:04.360
as much weight as they used to.

50:04.900 --> 50:06.130
It's hard enough

50:06.820 --> 50:09.420
to protect myself,
let alone help a friend out.

50:10.820 --> 50:12.530
Times are tough

50:12.530 --> 50:14.130
for everyone right now.

50:14.130 --> 50:15.740
But times like these are exactly when

50:15.740 --> 50:18.170
we buddies should help each other out.

50:18.200 --> 50:19.000
Tell you what,

50:19.070 --> 50:20.670
I'll give you an extra 10% cut

50:21.470 --> 50:23.220
from Tianxiang Sect's business—

50:23.220 --> 50:25.350
make life a little easier for you, bud.

50:25.570 --> 50:26.380
Truth be told,

50:26.380 --> 50:29.050
you're talking about
Tianxiang Sect's internal affairs,

50:29.050 --> 50:32.180
something a guy in uniform like me
can't get involved in.

50:33.200 --> 50:34.800
Then I'll add another 10%.

50:36.860 --> 50:37.990
How does that sound?

50:38.010 --> 50:40.650
You're truly a master of calculation.

50:40.680 --> 50:42.470
It's all thanks to you that

50:42.760 --> 50:45.430
I get to stick around in Yucheng.

50:48.670 --> 50:52.560
[Sever the Heavenly Light]

50:59.610 --> 51:00.810
Heaven hides no evil,

51:01.260 --> 51:02.790
and earth harbors no filth.

51:02.820 --> 51:04.780
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan have

51:04.870 --> 51:06.270
violated the sect rules

51:06.600 --> 51:07.750
and shall be subjected

51:07.750 --> 51:09.750
to the human oil candle punishment.

51:09.780 --> 51:11.130
Cleansing Matron.

51:12.520 --> 51:13.440
Proceed.

51:13.840 --> 51:14.680
Yes.

51:19.260 --> 51:20.940
Today, we have rebellious disciples

51:20.940 --> 51:22.450
who disrupted our sect's order.

51:22.450 --> 51:24.450
Kill them! Kill them!

51:24.700 --> 51:26.820
First, we invite the past sect masters

51:26.820 --> 51:29.820
to witness your crime
of betraying the sect!

51:29.890 --> 51:31.890
Kill them! Kill them!

51:34.970 --> 51:37.090
Second, we invite our fellow disciples

51:37.090 --> 51:39.740
to jointly execute you for your treachery.

51:39.820 --> 51:41.450
Kill them! Kill them!

51:45.260 --> 51:47.420
Third, I summon the disciplinary artifacts

51:47.420 --> 51:49.450
to chastise you renegades!

51:49.450 --> 51:51.170
Kill them! Kill them!

52:00.390 --> 52:01.590
The time has come.

52:02.510 --> 52:03.430
Execute them.

52:41.010 --> 52:43.280
[In the next episode]

52:43.490 --> 52:45.530
Haven't you been dying to kill me?

52:46.490 --> 52:47.130
Come on.

52:48.010 --> 52:49.210
I'll grant your wish.

52:50.050 --> 52:51.170
What a rare guest.

52:51.810 --> 52:52.680
Do you need something?

52:52.680 --> 52:53.380
Yes.

52:53.380 --> 52:54.300
What is it?

52:56.010 --> 52:56.780
A life exchange.

52:56.780 --> 52:57.820
Are you done living?

52:57.820 --> 52:58.650
Long ago.

52:58.650 --> 52:59.700
Deal.

53:01.340 --> 53:02.540
How do you want to die?

53:03.170 --> 53:04.220
I get to choose?

53:05.220 --> 53:06.170
Sure.

53:06.170 --> 53:08.220
You're so ruthless.

53:08.740 --> 53:10.090
Not as evil as you.

53:12.650 --> 53:14.130
Let me tell you something.

53:15.540 --> 53:18.210
You've met the real Shangguan Chengming.
